+  `https://matwbn.icm.edu.pl/ksiazki/aa/aa71/aa7122.pdf`
+  — `b629733a8c7c64007110e06e5ffc73212eb4b87bcbd6dbcf5416cac485c51a2d`.
+  Its Proposition 2/section 5 gives the equality-tree treatment.  Zannier's
+  priority addendum,
+  `https://matwbn.icm.edu.pl/ksiazki/aa/aa74/aa7447.pdf`, hashes to
+  `0ff263ee1baf3d54a18be83616784a262a1888df80e1470b7096a211b1cb7d91`.
+
+* Noah Snyder, “An Alternate Proof of Mason's Theorem,” *Elem. Math.* 55
+  (2000), 93--94, DOI `10.1007/S000170050074`.
+  `https://content.ems.press/assets/public/full-texts/serials/em/55/3/609/online/10.1007-s000170050074.pdf`
+  — `012e63dbe3d95a8caae8482354042e8c150509f35ef3b6c66a1ccc28fe707446`.
+  This is the accessible primary proof of the exact abc inequality used.
+
+* Tetsuji Shioda, “Elliptic Surfaces and Davenport--Stothers Triples,”
+  *Comment. Math. Univ. St. Pauli* 54 (2005), 49--68.
