+Vid. Selsk. Forh. (Trondheim)* 38 (1965), 86--87, is catalogued at
+`https://api.nb.no/catalog/v1/items/7da9d81e996452d10f014797c494b6e9`
+as legal-deposit-only (`viewability: NONE`).  Its bibliographic identity was
+cross-checked in the Davenport obituary
+`https://mathshistory.st-andrews.ac.uk/LMS/davenport_lms_obit.pdf`
+(`cf5433df2be1ca1aaea0b6f667adb20b5788cac2b345479a96c93e292ced3ab8`)
+and the official Acta bibliography
+`https://matwbn.icm.edu.pl/ksiazki/aa/aa18/aa1814.pdf`
+(`a10d3c5b61da4d8ce2383404c457340cbb754b8932a057a31528d23517c32a3c`).
+Stothers's 1981 paper, DOI `10.1093/qmath/32.3.349`, is subscriber-only at
+`https://academic.oup.com/qjmath/article-abstract/32/3/349/1593017`.
+Mason's 1984 book, DOI `10.1017/CBO9780511752490`, is likewise paywalled.
+The publisher preview (not the theorem text),
