   353	
   354	**Theorem (monogenic-resolvent no-go, conditional on the provisional row
   355	data).**  Let `D=V(F)` be an irreducible reduced affine sextic whose affine
   356	singularities are exactly three ordinary nodes and whose projective
   357	normalization has one point over infinity with the charged
